  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Object-based storage device video links such as Cloudflare R2, Amazon S3, and so on have download time limitations. When video files are relatively large, such as 3GB+video loading, VRCHAT can only have a download speed of 20-30MBPS. The link will fail after the time expires, and the video will stop playing directly. I hope there are new functions to solve these problems. Similar to reconnecting, or caching local at full speed.",
